@startuml 4+1 — Vue Scénarios : UC-02 Authentification MFA
title Scénario : Authentification à deux facteurs (MFA)

actor Client
participant "KrakenD :8080" as GW
participant "AuthController" as AC
participant "ClientService" as CS
participant "Redis\nmfa:challenge:*" as Redis
database "db_identity" as DB
participant "EmailService\n(MailHog)" as Mail

== Étape 1 : Login ==

Client -> GW : POST /api/auth/login\n{email, password}
GW -> AC    : POST /identityservice/auth/login
AC -> CS    : login(email, password)
CS -> DB    : SELECT * FROM clients WHERE email = ?
DB --> CS   : Client (passwordHash, status)
CS -> CS    : BCrypt.matches(password, hash)

alt Statut != ACTIVE
  CS --> AC : throw UnauthorizedException
  AC --> Client : 401 Unauthorized
end

CS -> CS    : generateChallengeToken() → UUID
CS -> Redis : SET mfa:challenge:{token} = clientId\nTTL 5 minutes
CS -> Mail  : send OTP email (code 6 chiffres)
CS --> AC   : {challengeToken}
AC --> Client : 200 OK {challengeToken}

== Étape 2 : Vérification MFA ==

Client -> GW : POST /api/auth/mfa\n{challengeToken, otpCode}
GW -> AC    : POST /identityservice/auth/mfa
AC -> CS    : verifyMfa(challengeToken, otpCode)
CS -> Redis : GET mfa:challenge:{challengeToken}

alt Token expiré ou inexistant
  Redis --> CS : null
  CS --> AC : throw UnauthorizedException
  AC --> Client : 401 Unauthorized
end

Redis --> CS : clientId
CS -> Redis : DEL mfa:challenge:{token}  (usage unique)
CS -> CS    : validateOtp(otpCode)

alt OTP invalide
  CS --> AC : throw UnauthorizedException
  AC --> Client : 401 Unauthorized
end

CS --> AC   : SUCCESS
AC --> Client : 200 OK {message: "SUCCESS"}

@enduml
